<title>UK: UBS sells stake in Daily Mail.</title>
<headline>UBS sells stake in Daily Mail.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Daily Mail &amp; General Trust Plc said on Friday that 10.245 million of its ordinary non-voting shares have been placed with institutional investors at a price of 1580 pence.</p>
<p>The placing represented the entire shareholding of Union Bank of Switzerland in the Daily Mail, said the newspaper group.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
